<rml>
<head>
    <title>Operation video</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="look.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="campaign.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="video.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Port-only (SPEC-menus.md, BRIEFING): the operation's video docked at the foot of the orders, the
     briefing around it as it was (the user's, 26 Nov: "a really small pop-out that downplays"; logistics/
     MCOperationVideo): the picture 1998's own size, under 1998's scan lines when HD; beside it the operation, how far
     along, PAUSE and CLOSE; the operation's picture while Betty says "incoming transmission". SPACE pauses, ESC closes;
     the briefing under it still takes the mouse and the other keys. -->
<body class="window-body video" data-model="video">
    <div class="stage16">
        <div class="content player-place">
            <div id="player" class="row">
                <div class="movie picture" data-style-height="height" data-style-decorator="still"><div class="frame" data-if="playing"></div></div>
                <div class="column info">
                    <div class="eyebrow" data-if="eyebrow != ''">{{eyebrow}}</div>
                    <div class="text white caps label">Operation briefing</div>
                    <div class="grow"></div>
                    <div class="data grey nowrap time">{{time}}</div>
                    <div class="meter"><div class="meter-fill" data-style-width="percent + '%'"></div></div>
                    <div class="controls row gap4">
                        <div class="grow"></div>
                        <div class="button small" id="pause" data-attr-data-hint="paused ? 'Play' : 'Pause'">{{paused ? 'Play' : 'Pause'}}</div>
                        <div class="button small" id="close" data-hint="Close" data-first>Close</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="hintbar">
        <div class="stage16">
            <div class="content">
                <div class="hints row"><div class="mouse-hints grow"></div><div class="keys"></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
